<div class="card-body">
<h6 class="fw-bold">HLC Young Authors</h6>
<p class="small">HLC Young Authors Program empowers rural students to write and publish books.</p>
<a href="{{ '/hlc-young-authors/' | url }}" class="text-decoration-none fw-semibold">5 min read</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-md-4">
<div class="card blog-card border-0 shadow-sm">
<img src="{{ '/assets/img/blogs/cultivating-a-culture-of-innovation.png' | url }}" class="img-fluid" alt="">
<div class="card-body">
<h6 class="fw-bold">Cultivating a Culture of Innovation</h6>
<p class="small">Hippocampus Schools foster creativity and innovation to prepare future-ready learners.</p>
<a href="{{ '/cultivating-a-culture-of-innovation/' | url }}" class="text-decoration-none fw-semibold">4 min read</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-md-4">
<div class="card blog-card border-0 shadow-sm">
<img src="{{ '/assets/img/blogs/digital-journalism.png' | url }}" class="img-fluid" alt="">
<div class="card-body">
<h6 class="fw-bold">Unleashing Young Voices</h6>
